  "details": "I noticed an issue in Favorite Friends on the VRChat website where friends who are actually offline continue to be displayed with the status they had when they were last online.\n\nThe status shown in the list does not match their actual current login status. In some cases, opening the individual user page of a user shown as online confirms that they are actually offline.\n\nThis issue has been occurring since at least 00:00 UTC on April 22, 2026.",
